# Mascot assets and pipeline stay local until the image rights are confirmed (PRD-001, open question 1).
# A theme's mascot code (src/**/mascot/) is tracked; its clips are fetched from core at build time
# (themes/*/mascot.lock.json, scripts/fetch-mascot.mjs; the lock sits outside assets/ so pack never ships it) and never committed.
public/auto/
/mascot/
themes/*/assets/mascot/

# Kit build output (built in CI, never committed)
packages/*/dist/
themes/*/dist/
*.autotheme
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
